  "prefLabel": "Acp 702.02 ADS Certificate Renewal Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 702.02 ADS Certificate Renewal Procedure. ADS certificate holders seeking to renew their certificates shall, on or before June 30 every other year, complete and submit an “Acupuncture Detoxification Specialist Renewal Application” form, effective July 2018.\n\nSource. #12575, eff 7-20-18",
